# === DocuQuery API Tests ===

### Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload a document (use form-data in Postman/curl)
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/upload -F "file=@uploads/abc.txt"

###

### Query - Retrieve relevant chunks from FAISS
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What programming languages does the author want to learn?"
}

###

### Ask - Full RAG pipeline (embed → search → LLM answer)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What programming languages does the author want to learn?"
}

###

### FAISS Server - Direct search
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query_vector": [],
  "k": 3
}
